      "asset": "rules",
      "record": {
        "id": "a-test-case-holds-at-most-50-criteria",
        "statement": "A Test Case holds at most as many acceptance criteria as the judge reads in one evaluation, twenty; one more is refused as over the limit, so no Test Case can carry a criterion the judge would never see.",
